# pass78-bak-exclude: keep sandbox rollback *.bak* backups OUT of the prod build context.
# (the .bak files remain on disk as documented FX-build rollback points — this only
#  excludes them from the image, per Commander's non-destructive request 2026-06-04.)
**/*.bak*
*.bak*
**/*.orig
*.orig
**/*~

# §MONEY-M3a (R32, 2026-09-03): the build-context env files carried a LIVE token-signing key
# into every shipped TEG image (/app/.env; frame-b and frame-c signed with it). Never again;
# only the tracked, secret-free .env.example may ride along.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
